TEXT 56 -112 Left 2 ;AQUILA | PHYSICAL 4TH-ORDER ACTIVE FILTER | schematic detail
TEXT 56 -64 Left 2 ;Same Sallen-Key topology as main block subcircuits. AC source is unity. Grounds/rails are ideal in this detail test.
TEXT 64 -16 Left 2 ;Positive feedback capacitor: first R junction -> amplifier OUTPUT. Shunt capacitor: +IN -> ground.
TEXT 64 32 Left 2 ;Edit matching values in aquila_hardware_parameters.inc; this sheet is an independent filter test, not the complete transmitter.
